# Claude Local Adapter
error-cla-agent-folder-missing = The agent's folder is missing. Restore it or choose another folder.
error-cla-allowance-exhausted = Your Claude allowance has run out, so the work stopped. Try again when it resets.
error-cla-auth-status-unreadable = ordin couldn't tell whether Claude Code is signed in. Try again.
error-cla-config-invalid = The Claude Code settings aren't valid. Check the folder is a full path and the sign-in details are complete.
error-cla-config-write-failed = ordin couldn't save the settings it needs to start Claude Code. Check there is free space and try again.
error-cla-deadline = Claude Code took too long to start. Try again.
error-cla-env-reserved = One of the settings names is reserved by ordin. Choose another name.
error-cla-harness-exited = Claude Code stopped before the work was finished. Try again.
error-cla-harness-not-found = ordin can't find Claude Code on this computer. Install it, then try again.
error-cla-harness-untested = This version of Claude Code hasn't been tested with ordin. It may not work as expected.
error-cla-hook-open-failed = ordin couldn't start watching Claude Code's actions. Try again.
error-cla-input-invalid = That command or its text isn't valid or is too long. Shorten it and try again.
error-cla-mcp-open-failed = ordin couldn't give Claude Code access to your connected apps. Try again.
error-cla-not-paused = That work isn't paused, so it can't be resumed.
error-cla-resume-mismatch = That answer doesn't match the approval the work is waiting for. Open the approval again.
error-cla-rules-unavailable = ordin couldn't check its rules for this work. Try again in a moment.
error-cla-run-start-ended = Your rules ended this work before it began.
error-cla-server-name-clash = A connected app's name is already taken by another. Rename one of them.
error-cla-session-exists = That work is already running.
error-cla-session-record-missing = ordin can't find the saved state of this work, so it can't continue. Start it again.
error-cla-session-record-save-failed = ordin couldn't save this work when it paused. Check there is free space and try again.
error-cla-setup-failed = ordin couldn't prepare Claude Code for this work. Try again.
error-cla-signed-out = Claude Code is signed out. Sign in to Claude Code again.
error-cla-sign-in-failed = Signing in to Claude Code didn't work. Try again.
error-cla-sign-in-status-failed = ordin couldn't check Claude Code's sign-in in time. Try again.
error-cla-spawn-failed = ordin couldn't start Claude Code. Check it is installed and try again.
error-cla-stop-deadline = Claude Code didn't stop when asked. Close it from your computer if it is still running.
error-cla-stream-line-too-long = Claude Code sent a message that was too long for ordin to read. Try again.
error-cla-stream-malformed = Claude Code sent messages ordin couldn't understand, so the work stopped. Try again.
error-cla-target-mismatch = This work is meant for a remote agent, not Claude Code on this computer. Choose another agent.
error-cla-turn-failed = Claude Code couldn't finish that. Try again.
error-cla-unknown-run = ordin can't find that work. It may have already finished.
error-cla-version-check-failed = ordin couldn't check which version of Claude Code is installed. Try again.
